      "id": "aa6765bf-7e55-4b4a-a53f-6f5b2a0d1ac6",
      "name": "Scrape ExpiredDomains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-scrapeunblocker.scrapeUnblocker",
      "notes": "Public listing page (no login). If you have a paid ExpiredDomains.net account, swap this URL for your saved-search export URL — it will include your keyword/TLD/age filters server-side and give cleaner columns to parse.",
      "position": [
